# Task 149-024 Execution Plan
# TR/EN Parity + Link Checker

## Objective
Create two scripts:
1. `scripts/i18n-parity.mjs` — TR ↔ EN doc section parity check
2. `scripts/link-checker.mjs` — Markdown internal link validator

Generate report: `docs/audits/sprint-149/i18n-parity-report.md`

## Document Pairs to Check (i18n-parity.mjs)
- README.md ↔ README-TR.md
- VISION.md ↔ VISION-TR.md
- BETA-TRACKER.md ↔ BETA-TRACKER-TR.md
- DECKENT-MASTER-BLUEPRINT.md ↔ DECKENT-ANA-PLAN-TR.md

## Implementation Plan

### scripts/i18n-parity.mjs
1. Read each EN doc → extract all ## and ### headings
2. Read each TR doc → extract all ## and ### headings
3. Normalize: strip emojis, lowercase, remove Turkish special chars
4. Compare sets → report missing/extra sections
5. Output: console table + report markdown

### scripts/link-checker.mjs
1. Glob all .md files in workspace (excluding node_modules, dist)
2. For each file: extract all [text](link) patterns
3. Classify: internal file link vs external URL vs anchor (#)
4. Internal: check file exists
5. Anchors: skip (heading matching complex)
6. External: do NOT make HTTP requests (no network — just report as SKIPPED)
7. Output: broken links list + summary

### docs/audits/sprint-149/i18n-parity-report.md
- Generated by i18n-parity.mjs
- Table: doc pair, EN sections, TR sections, missing in TR, extra in TR

